  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Institute for Training (UNOSAT)    2010 - 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">United Nations Institute for Training (UNOSAT)    2010 - 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rse det humanit&#xe4;ra samfundet med satellitbaserad information f&#xf6;r    krishantering och samordning.Detta inkluderar karttj&#xe4;nster,           installation av h&#xe5;rd-och mjukvara, svara p&#xe5; ans&#xf6;kningar fr&#xe5;n FN och   IASC. Garantera en mer f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;gbar finansiering f&#xf6;r satellitbaserad   kartl&#xe4;ggning f&#xf6;r katastrofhantering, som bygger p&#xe5; UNOSATs befintliga kapacitet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide the humanitarian community with space based geographic        information for crisis response and relief coordination. This include rapid mapping services, installing hardware and software, responding  to all requests for mapping emanating from UN and IASC. Ensure more   predictable funding for satellite-based rapid mapping for emergency   response, building on UNOSAT&apos;s existing capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
